OL,3,GNEWSACity swimming pool to undergo
OL,4,A#1.4m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular city swimming pool is set to
OL,7,Fundergo a "major improvement programme"
OL,8,Fcosting #1.4m.
OL,10,FWork will begin in September to revamp
OL,11,Fthe pool at Leisure World Colchester,
OL,12,Fwith changing facilities and the
OL,13,Fexternal flumes in line for a full
OL,14,Fupgrade.
OL,16,FThe pool is expected to reopen in early
OL,17,F2027 - but other facilities within
OL,18,FLeisure World Colchester will remain
OL,19,Fopen as normal, the city council
OL,20,Fconfirmed.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
