OL,3,GNEWSACity swimming pool to undergo
OL,4,A#1.4m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat city councillor for
OL,7,Fthe Mile End ward, Martin Goss, said:
OL,8,F"This is one of the most significant
OL,9,Finvestments in the Leisure Pool in
OL,10,Frecent years and demonstrates our
OL,11,Fcommitment to providing attractive
OL,12,Fleisure facilities for our residents
OL,13,Fand visitors."
